  "description": "Meet Karsearin, AKA Arin, the first-ever dragon to run away from home! One day, Arin uses Polymorph magic to transform himself into a human and embarks on an adventure to the human world. But the human world is treacherous. Join in his adventure as he gets chased by orcs, gets sold away, and even becomes a princess! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
